  "ruleText": "Rev 403.01 Definition. For purposes of this part, “veterans’ tax credit” means the standard or optional veterans’ tax credits pursuant to RSA 72:28.\n\nSource. #2080, eff 7-5-82; ss by #2821, eff 8-17-84, EXPIRED: 8-17-94\n\nNew. #5911, eff 10-14-94; ss by #7410, eff 11-23-00; (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Rev 400) #9309, eff 10-30-08; ss by #12027, eff 10-28-16",
